<title>POLAND: Stomil sees 1996 payout at PLN 0.4/share.</title>
<headline>Stomil sees 1996 payout at PLN 0.4/share.</headline>
<dateline>POZNAN, Poland 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The management of Polish tyre maker Stomil Olsztyn SA wants to set the firm's 1996 dividend at 0.4 zloty per share, the company's financial director said on Friday.</p>
</text>
